@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我来按时间顺序<br>整理一下经过。|#0102Trial14_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:从奈叶香<br>发现尸体<br>离开房间<br>到雪莉打开房门的<br>这段时间里<br>惩罚室是密室状态……|#0102Trial14_Ema002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而正是在这段时间里，<br>有人听见房间里<br>传来米莉亚的【惨叫声】。|#0102Trial14_Ema003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果奈叶香的证词是真的，<br>她之前就已经死了，<br>那这声惨叫<br>就是录下的<br>声音……|#0102Trial14_Ema004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Closed03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后这份录音<br>被某人删掉了……|#0102Trial14_Ema005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:进入房间以后，<br>第一个找到<br>米莉亚手机的<br>就是安安——|#0102Trial14_Ema006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"——但那时吾辈<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_14_01\">没有时间清除数据</link>！<br>也就是说，<br>那声<link=\"Objection_01_02_14_02\">惨叫是真的</link>！<br>米莉亚当时<br>毫无疑问<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_14_03\">还活着</link>！<br>|#0102Trial14_AnAn001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:一切都是奈叶香的谎言……<br>是她杀害了<br>米莉亚！！|#0102Trial14_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

